<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Painewebber starts Daisytek.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Painewebber starts Daisytek.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Walter Winnitzki started Daisytek International Corp as a buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
